{
    "title": "Giggle Babies - Toddler Care",
    "description": "Have you ever wondered what it would be like to run a toddler daycare & be a babysitter? Have you ever wanted to look after cute and funny babies and toddlers or play fun baby games with Giggle Babies? Become a babysitter in this cute baby daycare game Giggle Babies - Toddler Care - the ultimate destination for fun and educational baby games! Run a super cute babies' daycare, take care of the toddlers, play baby games, feed the babies, dress them up and most importantly - have fun!\r\n\r\n<b>Take care of cute babies in daycare</b>\r\nGive them food to calm their hungry tummies, bathe them so they smell clean and sweet, train cute toddlers to go potty, play baby games with them, and be the best virtual daycare babysitter in the world! The babies will thank you for all the care!\r\n\r\n<b>Play fun baby games & mini-games</b>\r\nDo you know what cute babies love to do the most? Play baby games! Get ready to have a blast while playing these delightful baby games! Be the best babysitter and take your toddlers with you to play mini-games. This collection of baby games includes an exciting jumper mini-game, a cute drawing mini-game, or even fidget toys & pop-its! Jump together, draw together, and play with pop-it fidget toys! Play baby games, have fun, and don't forget to collect cute prizes!\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on a chance to care for and become best buddies with these cute and adorable babies! Explore the world of Giggle Babies and let your imagination run wild in these delightful baby games together. Become a babysitter at this wonderful daycare full of little toddlers! Download now, play, and take care!\r\n\r\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -\r\n\r\nAbout TutoTOONS Baby Games for Kids\r\nCrafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing the games they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experience to millions of children worldwide.\r\n\r\nImportant Message to Parents\r\nThis app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.\r\n\r\nDiscover More Fun with TutoTOONS!\r\n\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS\r\n\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com\r\n\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons\r\n\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Have you ever wondered what it would be like to run a toddler daycare &amp; be a babysitter? Have you ever wanted to look after cute and funny babies and toddlers or play fun baby games with Giggle Babies? Become a babysitter in this cute baby daycare game Giggle Babies - Toddler Care - the ultimate destination for fun and educational baby games! Run a super cute babies&#39; daycare, take care of the toddlers, play baby games, feed the babies, dress them up and most importantly - have fun!<br><br><b>Take care of cute babies in daycare</b><br>Give them food to calm their hungry tummies, bathe them so they smell clean and sweet, train cute toddlers to go potty, play baby games with them, and be the best virtual daycare babysitter in the world! The babies will thank you for all the care!<br><br><b>Play fun baby games &amp; mini-games</b><br>Do you know what cute babies love to do the most? Play baby games! Get ready to have a blast while playing these delightful baby games! Be the best babysitter and take your toddlers with you to play mini-games. This collection of baby games includes an exciting jumper mini-game, a cute drawing mini-game, or even fidget toys &amp; pop-its! Jump together, draw together, and play with pop-it fidget toys! Play baby games, have fun, and don&#39;t forget to collect cute prizes!<br><br>Don&#39;t miss out on a chance to care for and become best buddies with these cute and adorable babies! Explore the world of Giggle Babies and let your imagination run wild in these delightful baby games together. Become a babysitter at this wonderful daycare full of little toddlers! Download now, play, and take care!<br><br>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -<br><br>About TutoTOONS Baby Games for Kids<br>Crafted and play-tested with kids and toddlers, TutoTOONS games foster kids\u2019 creativity and help them learn while playing the games they love. Fun and educational TutoTOONS games strive to bring meaningful and safe mobile experience to millions of children worldwide.<br><br>Important Message to Parents<br>This app is free to download and play, but there may be certain in-game items that can be purchased for real money. By downloading this app you agree to TutoTOONS Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.<br><br>Discover More Fun with TutoTOONS!<br>\u00b7 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TutoTOONS<br>\u00b7 Learn more about us: https://tutotoons.com<br>\u00b7 Read our blog: https://blog.tutotoons.com<br>\u00b7 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/tutotoons<br>\u00b7 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tutotoons/",
